  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Common themes"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Both extracts deal with marginalisation and the loss of dignity, the pain of a child discovering injustice, and the struggle to keep one's identity. Zitkala-Sa faces cultural and racial oppression in the name of \"civilising\" her; Bama faces the daily humiliation of caste. Both show a spirit of protest and the importance of self-respect."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Marginalisation and dignity"
    },
    {
     "en": "Identity under attack"
    },
    {
     "en": "A spirit of protest"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Both extracts deal with marginalisation and the loss of dignity, the pain of a child discovering injustice, and the struggle to keep one's identity. Zitkala-Sa faces cultural and racial oppression in the name of \"civilising\" her; Bama faces the daily humiliation of caste. Both show a spirit of protest and the importance of self-respect."
